# CONTEXT: local dev of marketing only. Copy to .env.local (all public, build-time).

# Funnel destinations. Leave unset: links default to /demo, /docs and /sign-up on the current
# origin. This standalone shell has no demo or dashboard of its own, so set these to point at
# a running deployment when you need the CTAs to land somewhere.
# NEXT_PUBLIC_DEMO_URL=
# NEXT_PUBLIC_DOCS_URL=
# NEXT_PUBLIC_APP_URL=
